OL,3,GNEWSALidl set to beat Aldi in race for
OL,4,Atown supermarket
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil officials have recommended just
OL,7,Fone discount supermarket should be
OL,8,Fbuilt in a town where two rival firms
OL,9,Fhave been vying to open about 800m (0.5
OL,10,Fmiles) apart.
OL,12,FLidl wants to open off Nightjar Road in
OL,13,FHolt and planners have told councillors
OL,14,Fthey should approve the scheme at a
OL,15,Fmeeting next week.
OL,17,FOn the other hand, officials are
OL,18,Fopposed to Aldi's planning application
OL,19,Ffor land off Old Station Way due to
OL,20,Froad safety concerns.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
