OL,3,GNEWSALidl set to beat Aldi in race for
OL,4,Atown supermarket
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth German companies have gained
OL,7,Fsupport locally from more than 300
OL,8,Fpeople wanting the stores to open, with
OL,9,Fsome arguing Holt needed "more
OL,10,Faffordable" food options.
